          "settings": {
            "icon": "diamond",
            "title": "Uncompromising curation",
            "text": "<p>We believe that less is more. Our selection process is painstaking, deliberate, and driven by a single question: does this product truly deserve a place in someone's ritual?</p><p>Less than 8% of products submitted make it onto our platform. The rest are returned with a personal note explaining why.</p>",
